== Trivia ==
* The item resembles the [[wikipedia:Ichthys|Ichthys symbol]], which was a symbol used by early Christians, and is associated with Jesus Christ.
* The halo produced by the item resembles Jesus' Crown of Thorns, and the filename for the effect's graphics is <code>halo_thorns.png</code>.
* {{E|Dogma}} and its television will have a wavy and distorted appearance while in range of Salvation.
* Salvation is especially effective against segmented bosses, as each segment can be targeted by an initial beam, and the cardinal beams deal extra damage by damaging other segments.

